      "claim": "This historical collapse proves that treating systemic risk as a predictable business expense creates a moral hazard.",
      "targets": ["AN-19"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "Prometheus’s proposal essentially creates a 'license to harm' that commodifies existential risk.",
      "targets": ["AN-19"]
    },
